{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "595556f9595d3aaaab4ac1612e2f4d6a2c1008b133754bf4260a1a3a78178ba9", "ja": "昂れ！　アイドル6人タッグマッチ", "zh": "激昂吧！偶像6人双打组合赛", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "af883c027cb07d5bbecc374b0fd8044c5fb805bfc06564fed98a4fcadab87289", "ja": "冷静になって自分の行動を振り返るのり子。\nネガティブモードに入ってしまうが、仲間の\n励ましで、気分は最高潮に！　そして迎えた\n試合当日。本隊VS反体制派にわかれた\nアイドル達が熱い試合を繰り広げる！", "zh": "冷静下来反思自己行为的福田法子。\n虽然陷入了消极模式，但在伙伴们的\n鼓励下，心情变得无比高涨！而这一天终于\n迎来了比赛当天。分为本队VS反体制派的\n偶像们展开了一场热血的比赛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c970e07ca8c27e8d2c78b8943707c34b2a83cbd776851b0a689928110121b640", "ja": "（アングルにムーブを組み込みたいという翼の提案に、\nのり子が消極的な態度を見せた……何故！？）", "zh": "（翼提议想把动作融入镜头，\n可为什么则子却表现得很消极……到底是为什么！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "9281e1530ac42baa13a39ce511c680b0993b2d5812de093fd1050e7b7b0f0689", "ja": "どうしたの？　のり子ちゃん。\nいつもなら、一番喜びそうな話なのに……？", "zh": "怎么了？纪子。\n明明平时你应该是最喜欢这种话题的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "ec13d1ed112903173919e97b44e27e6b6dacbae3ecb8d352571f9d80eaf7b5c1", "ja": "もしかして、わたしや春香さんが\nプロレスを怖がっていたから、それでですか？", "zh": "难道是因为我和春香小姐\n害怕摔角，所以才这样的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "7329d7357717313dc023b14e6423098d705b857bafc9ed5ab17df59add0e277c", "ja": "うぅ……まあ、それもなくはないんだけど……\nなんか、ちょっと冷静になっちゃってさ。", "zh": "呜……唔，倒也不是完全没有那方面的原因啦……\n只是感觉，自己一下子冷静下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "a4eef7ba4e358a6405b8c7e8fc6481f90de314eb4811172f64a53217d9fbb83c", "ja": "今回の仕事、アタシはずっと好きってだけで\n突っ走ってきちゃったけど、よかったのかなーって……", "zh": "这次的工作，我一直只是凭着喜欢就一股脑冲过来了，可这样真的好吗——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "fd6f0a8f804c85473eb4ca3b168b61964b03b557ef21b36e1bbf02ce00378f59", "ja": "えっ、今更……？", "zh": "诶，现在才来问……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "c078c7fdf864d7f8d0da54e33457d8a846d451cc2395c821fd3e18b75622cdb5", "ja": "でもさ、思い返してみると、色々強引だったよね！？\n春香と星梨花に、上から目線でアドバイスしたり……", "zh": "不过回想一下，我之前确实做得挺强势的吧！？还居高临下地给春香和星梨花提建议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "309a30006bd7f913d7c6ffbdd1268313c8648bde104829a4c83c6144f525a463", "ja": "翼におせっかいなこと言ったり……\nうわーっ！　アタシ、やっちゃってるじゃん！", "zh": "还对翼说了些多管闲事的话……呜哇！我这不是一直在多管闲事嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "31f83c563c20da90b9841d49e5b655a0232ece208be86c6113e11daca5fbc249", "ja": "落ち着きなさいって、のり子。\n別にいいじゃない、強引だって。ねえ？", "zh": "冷静一点，乃子。强硬一点也没什么不好嘛。对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "541d7dc7e15460126c059912d76ba76a6bd7be59c522ffd59b5cb4d2730482d8", "ja": "ええ、別にイヤじゃないですよ。\nむしろ、引っ張ってもらって助かってます。", "zh": "嗯，我并不讨厌哦。\n倒不如说，谢谢你拉着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "802790a3001d7f9da6093b7a67de55100e72e963ddd7a1fb643b64348895468e", "ja": "そうですよー。\n大丈夫ですよ、のり子さん！", "zh": "就是这样啦。\n没关系的，纪子姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b1214e5983c3f440ba3af501205a55568d235f76f49ba1644fd6df45ce2ed7c4", "ja": "最初は、カワイイわたしには合わないかもって\n思ってましたけど。", "zh": "一开始，我还以为这种风格可能不适合可爱的我呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "e72bca5bea14b18312e68d2a0d104c1f8ef1d75a70810dae58f2ad21852993e1", "ja": "翼……。", "zh": "翼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "34c164303cb8cf6afd6ad5f69711907f298eeff6feee1726e36fef57c777884a", "ja": "ヒールにも色々あるって教えてもらって、\nけっこう楽しくなってきたし。", "zh": "听你教了我原来高跟鞋也有各种各样的款式，我也觉得挺有意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "004292c3d2e0a79aa4c60b8f826e86450530818efce23e9e68c1ba517439f569", "ja": "だから、おせっかいなんて言わないでほしいな～。\nわたしを乗せたんだから、責任とってくださいよ♪", "zh": "所以，不要说什么多管闲事嘛～。既然是你把我带上这条路的，就请负责到底哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "eebaca1ec9a08290d97efd3923530609dac049f9284d74a869e30ea4503f91c5", "ja": "そうだよのり子ちゃん、一緒に突っ走ろう！\n私、食らいついていくから。", "zh": "是啊，法子，一起放马狂奔吧！\n我会紧紧跟上的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "51a6df63f302e8ff0758f7b84e42243295de2ed8f0c72230893e0f75db4dc9cf", "ja": "わたしも、のり子さんと一緒に戦いたいです！\nプロレスの技、教えてください♪", "zh": "我也想和法子小姐一起并肩作战！\n请教我职业摔角招式吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "6d03b560e0ee49f3f615f746662d39ed465d303d75c8442c03c879623f4e5796", "ja": "み、みんな……。", "zh": "大、大家……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "15bb401736066e179d18c756351d017f94e9985f5b0aaaab1215772a3086c370", "ja": "傍から見ていても、強引とは思わなかったよ。\nむしろのり子の熱意に、助けてもらったと思う。", "zh": "就算从旁边看，也不觉得她做得强硬。\n反倒是她的热情帮助了大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "602c6b3d1c30c465f5434016e0eb13a81515ade71020c46ef4fc13a0b2954601", "ja": "のり子が無理にやらせたんじゃない。\nみんなが、のり子に応えたんだ。プロレスだからな！", "zh": "不是诺莉子强迫大家这么做的。\n是大家回应了诺莉子。因为这就是职业摔角啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "2fdbd8834c8b13a2d97d99f60aa72292a085460139441bc8664d8bb3ce6e5d71", "ja": "う、うぅ……ダメだ！　まだ泣けないっ！\nまだ、始まりのゴングさえ鳴ってないんだから……！", "zh": "呜、呜……不行！现在还不能哭！\n毕竟连开场的锣声都还没敲响呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "b5ada5c2145537ced329692077da06cab947bc4d8dffe1da814f36b333fc3a0b", "ja": "アタシ、もう迷わない！　みんなと最後まで、\n駆け抜けてみせるよ！　うおおおーっ！", "zh": "我已经不会再迷茫了！我要和大家一起奋战到最后！呜哦哦哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1022_dakuandou", "source_sha256": "b3461f950f6ab4e6cfadd0831c68bf3eb496dcc396c01be331064192d8e88a6e", "ja": "ヒャッハーッ！　おい光井よぉ……\nこりゃ、オレたちも負けてられねえなぁ！？", "zh": "呀哈哈——！喂，光井啊……  \n这下我们也不能输啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1023_esumitui", "source_sha256": "735424192163deb0d5683268a10a4cc0c4f544a5b886d53d78d5f84de10e4402", "ja": "そうだね、闇堂！　恥ずかしい試合にはできない……\nみんな、スパーリングするよ！", "zh": "没错，闇堂！不能打成一场丢人的比赛……  \n大家，开始对练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1024_p", "source_sha256": "80f1b93140ad4e45f81ee41ded1c4f8dcd71ce77773842ce2a5227119fec5785", "ja": "（こっちまで熱くなってきた……よし、当日までの\nプロモの仕掛けを一気にまとめるぞ！　うおおーっ！）", "zh": "（连我也越来越热血沸腾了……好，把比赛当天之前的宣传安排一口气全都整理好！呜哦哦——！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "c33153bc8653326c828753dda51d94b724770272cb9b1d8da0dd6728625dcc58", "ja": "（ついに、試合当日がやってきた。\nホールは超満員、地鳴りのような歓声だ……！）", "zh": "（终于到了比赛当天。会场里座无虚席，欢呼声如同大地轰鸣一般……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1027_jikyou", "source_sha256": "4523a6f58e75386288d02e4b7d1fdb2bead926ca83242dd44b3c37ab30bb541b", "ja": "さあ、いよいよメインイベント！　本隊と反体制派の\n因縁に、新たな歴史が刻まれようとしています！", "zh": "来吧，终于到了主活动！本队与反体制派之间的宿怨，即将刻下新的历史！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1028_jikyou", "source_sha256": "9a85200ba4645ebd2854475db42e745d5fc0d293214baf6256de93e0a211b9de", "ja": "……ですがその前に、なんと両陣営に、\n応援団が駆けつけてくれました！　解説の小柳さん！", "zh": "……不过在那之前，居然有应援团\n赶来为双方阵营加油助威了！解说小柳先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1029_kaisetu", "source_sha256": "9488671da480d81f74858ac69a9ef847eb96d799cdd3411f85b8e0d7e608ee5c", "ja": "いやあ、この殺気！　ただ事じゃないですよ……。\n異様な熱気に包まれています。", "zh": "哎呀，这股杀气！可非同小可啊……\n到处都笼罩着异样的狂热。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "fecee2cf040cba53fbd45c80bb2d847cfe09755dba9534dbd242db6ff7ee2812", "ja": "星梨花、いい子ちゃんのあなたには、\nこのリングは過酷すぎるわ。", "zh": "星梨花，对于你这个乖孩子来说，这个擂台太残酷了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "db2a1f9c27d0c522b22972f68e4bfd7e6fe49536a9bcf11a846c2eca424c8035", "ja": "パパの言うことを聞いて、家で大人しく\nしていればよかったのに……痛い目を見せてあげる。", "zh": "听你爸爸的话，乖乖待在家里不就好了……看来得让你吃点苦头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1032_022ser", "source_sha256": "ff5ef32d02cacffb26dc28386cfa327be3dd49aad121cc390b77eb108d5d26ea", "ja": "志保さん、そんなこと言っておどかしたってダメです！\nわたし、志保さんにだって負けませんよ！", "zh": "志保小姐，就算说那种话吓唬我也没用的！\n我是不会输给志保小姐的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "92e5d30884d9ce1d7397fa6d34d6506d7db4d93034dd3b2ce6c8013526676be7", "ja": "パパだって、スープレックスしちゃいますっ！", "zh": "就连爸爸，我也会使出抱摔哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1034_jikyou", "source_sha256": "e41354eaa4257fcac9b1e7af3e5dd0ca0a8c0a69fa3acf746745228022908439", "ja": "おーっと、これは……\n箱崎さんのお父さんの安否が危ぶまれます！", "zh": "哎呀，这可……箱崎小姐的父亲安危堪忧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1035_kaisetu", "source_sha256": "9cd4c56a2cc97975ce73fd8155c0aa8ba845358e474329f900d21e4445ec8fac", "ja": "お父さん、バンプの練習をしておいてください。", "zh": "爸爸，请提前练习好撞击。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1036_001har", "source_sha256": "0adcaf7a90b75464632797e2ecfab7f919716e9df06fb114598d662377172652", "ja": "律子さん！　なんで反体制派なんかに……\n私の一撃で、目を覚ましてください！", "zh": "律子小姐！为什么要去反体制派那种地方……\n吃我一击，清醒过来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1037_009rit", "source_sha256": "a0a3b5e2caea68e78c3d782eea623496e74cf2b5210d6df32e02b1084fed8683", "ja": "上等じゃない。仲良しごっこの得意なあなたが、\nどこまでやれるか……見せてみなさい？", "zh": "不错嘛。就让我看看，擅长装好朋友的你，究竟能做到什么地步……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1038_001har", "source_sha256": "e96512125f41d45b420915b59210e3b75c500965352baf7f715ac262c8a15887", "ja": "えーいっ……っと、とっと！？　わ、わわーっ！", "zh": "嘿——……呀、呀？！哇、哇哇——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1039_009rit", "source_sha256": "7f86f1feb9a5172b4e606110499c65ecc80c65bd125600591b4c2343059c575d", "ja": "ちょ、春香！？　……きゃあっ！", "zh": "等等，春香！？……呀啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1040_null", "source_sha256": "ba8fec30e546c204ae6a2a9aeae3d7cc18cd4733592bdbe2e10442962f73bb30", "ja": "どんがらがっしゃーん！　ドバーン！", "zh": "哐啷啷——！轰——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1041_jikyou", "source_sha256": "470f357bf3188b6b720b84a2d0e23ed5a6b837e2639f27943106978e8d6e26f5", "ja": "天海さんが、転んだーっ！？", "zh": "天海小姐摔倒了——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1042_kaisetu", "source_sha256": "85ea87d666072dd7c020c1829691fbf6bd55f1187d551ecd373ebd37207b3d0a", "ja": "いや……違う！　これは……秋月さんを巻き込んだ、\nどんがらスプラッシュだー！　決まったーっ！", "zh": "不对……不是！这是……把秋月小姐也卷进来的咚嘎啦飞溅——！完美——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1043_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4bf77ff019bba77d495ec72d487a531023c48c1bdf8090fbd22a9f68f10de363", "ja": "あはっ、律子さんも意外とだらしないんですね～。\nあの程度でやられちゃうなんて、よわよわ～。", "zh": "啊哈，律子姐也意外地不太行嘛～  \n居然被那种程度就干掉了，弱爆啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1044_043nor", "source_sha256": "5d5962970c2e7fb45fd534786761d8a1b782998b1dd16f5277cce03c74f40667", "ja": "翼、ずいぶん余裕じゃん。\n仲間が心配とか、そういうのはないワケ？", "zh": "翼，你还真是从容啊。\n就没有担心同伴什么的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1045_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f8e8882b97213115f6f24dfe295a8dbd8e5f0081ec9072c517259aab30207408", "ja": "雑魚に興味ないですもん♪　のり子さん、\nちょっとは面白くしてくださいよ～？", "zh": "我对杂鱼没兴趣嘛♪ 典子小姐，你也稍微变得有趣一点嘛～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_06_1046_043nor", "source_sha256": "0f5d3310dee42e72517a7a238c184df99ab6a6783abd1c0a787c8cf62eccae0b", "ja": "ふふっ、上等だよ！　……はあーっ！", "zh": "呵呵，正合我意！……哈啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
